#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:31
msgid "Speech to Text"
msgstr "Reč na text"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:33
msgid ""
"Speech to text does not work with version 21.04.2 due to `Vosk API <https://"
"github.com/alphacep/vosk-api>`__ issues. Use version 21.04.1 or 21.04.3 and "
"later versions."
msgstr ""
"Prevod reči na text nefunguje vo verzii 21.04.2 kvôli problémom s `Vosk API "
"<https://github.com/alphacep/vosk-api>`__. Použite verziu 21.04.1 alebo "
"21.04.3 a novšie verzie."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:36
msgid ""
"Before you can use Speech to Text, it must be properly configured and speech "
"models installed. Please refer to the chapter :doc:`Configure Speech to Text "
"</getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
"Pred použitím funkcie Prevod reči na text je potrebné ju správne "
"nakonfigurovať a nainštalovať rečové modely. Prečítajte si kapitolu :doc:"
"`Nakonfigurovať prevod reči na text</getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:38
msgid ""
"While you can configure and set up both, VOSK and Whisper, for speech "
"recognition, the engine that is selected in the :doc:`Speech to Text </"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>` configuration "
"section is being used for speech recognition the next time you use this "
"feature. You can switch back and forth during editing, of course, and use "
"different engines for different purposes. The Speech Editor widget has a "
"menu entry to quickly access the configuration section bypassing the :"
"menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive -->` :doc:`Speech to "
"Text </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>` route."
msgstr ""
"Hoci môžete nakonfigurovať a nastaviť oba engine, VOSK aj Whisper, pre "
"rozpoznávanie reči, pri ďalšom použití tejto funkcie sa použije engine "
"vybraný v konfiguračnej časti :doc:`Prevod reči na text</getting_started/"
"configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`. Počas úprav môžete samozrejme "
"prepínať medzi enginemi a používať rôzne engine na rôzne účely. Widget "
"Editor reči má položku ponuky na rýchly prístup do konfiguračnej časti bez "
"potreby použiť cestu :menuselection:`Ponuka --> Nastavenia --> Nastaviť "
"Kdenlive -->` :doc:`Prevod reči na text</getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:42
msgid "Speech Recognition"
msgstr "Rozpoznávanie reči"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:44
