msgstr "Existujú dva príklady použitia rozpoznávania reči:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:46
msgid "Creating subtitles automatically"
msgstr "Automatické vytváranie titulkov"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:47
msgid ""
"Creating :ref:`transcripts <creating_clips_by_speech_recognition>` and the "
"ability to :ref:`add clips to the timeline "
"<creating_clips_by_speech_recognition>` based on the transcript"
msgstr ""
"Vytváranie :ref:`prepisov<creating_clips_by_speech_recognition>` a možnosť :"
"ref:`pridávať klipy na časovú os<creating_clips_by_speech_recognition>` na "
"základe prepisu"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:78
msgid "Creating Subtitles using VOSK Speech Recognition"
msgstr "Vytváranie titulkov pomocou rozpoznávania reči VOSK"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:82
msgid ""
"If not yet created, add a subtitle track by clicking on the |add-subtitle|"
"\\ :guilabel:`Edit Subtitle Tool` icon in the Timeline tool bar (**6**)."
msgstr ""
"Ak ešte nebola vytvorená, pridajte stopu titulkov kliknutím na ikonu |add-"
"subtitle|\\ :guilabel:`Nástroj na úpravu titulkov` na paneli nástrojov "
"časovej osi (**6**)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:89
msgid "Automatic subtitle generation using the VOSK engine"
msgstr "Automatické generovanie titulkov pomocou engine VOSK"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:91
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:135
msgid ""
"|tools-wizard|\\ :guilabel:`Speech recognition`. Click here to open the "
"**Automatic Subtitling** dialog window."
msgstr ""
"|tools-wizard|\\ :guilabel:`Rozpoznávanie reči`. Kliknite sem na otvorenie "
"dialógového okna **Automatické titulkovanie**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:93
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:137
msgid ""
"Timeline Zone. More details about Timeline Zones can be found in the "
"chapter :ref:`timeline_ruler`."
msgstr ""
"Zóna časovej osi. Ďalšie podrobnosti o zónach časovej osi nájdete v "
"kapitole :ref:`timeline_ruler`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:95
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:139
msgid "Choose which part of the timeline should be used for speech recognition"
msgstr "Vyberte, ktorá časť časovej osi sa má použiť na rozpoznávanie reči"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:97
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:143
msgid ":guilabel:`Process`. Click to start the recognition"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Spracovať`. Kliknite na spustenie rozpoznávania"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:99
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:141
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model`. Select the model for the language of the subtitles. You "
"can install more models in the Configuration section :doc:`Speech to Text </"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Model`. Vyberte model pre jazyk titulkov. Ďalšie modely môžete "
"nainštalovať v konfiguračnej časti :doc:`Prevod reči na text</"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:101
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:153
msgid ""
"|add-subtitle|\\ :guilabel:`Edit Subtitle Tool`. Click to open or close the "
"subtitle track."
msgstr ""
"|add-subtitle|\\ :guilabel:`Nástroj na úpravu titulkov`. Kliknite na "
"otvorenie alebo zatvorenie stopy titulkov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:104
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:156
msgid "Steps to create subtitles using VOSK speech recognition"
msgstr "Kroky na vytvorenie titulkov pomocou rozpoznávania reči VOSK"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:105
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:157
msgid "(numbers in brackets point to the GUI element in the screenshot above):"
msgstr ""
"(čísla v zátvorkách odkazujú na prvok GUI na vyššie uvedenej snímke "
"obrazovky):"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:107
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:159
msgid ""
"|tools-wizard|\\ :guilabel:`Speech recognition` (**1**). Click here to open "
"the **Automatic Subtitling** dialog window."
msgstr ""
"|tools-wizard|\\ :guilabel:`Rozpoznávanie reči` (**1**). Kliknite sem na "
"otvorenie dialógového okna **Automatické titulkovanie**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:109
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:161
msgid ""
"If needed, define a timeline zone (**2**) for which you want to use speech "
"recognition. More details about Timeline Zones can be found in the chapter :"
"ref:`timeline_ruler`."
msgstr ""
"V prípade potreby definujte zónu časovej osi (**2**), pre ktorú chcete "
"použiť rozpoznávanie reči. Ďalšie podrobnosti o zónach časovej osi nájdete v "
"kapitole :ref:`timeline_ruler`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:111
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:163
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Model` (**5**). Select the model for the language of the "
"subtitles. You can install more models in the Configuration section :doc:"
"`Speech to Text </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Model` (**5**). Vyberte model pre jazyk titulkov. Ďalšie modely "
"môžete nainštalovať v konfiguračnej časti :doc:`Prevod reči na text</"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:113
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:165
msgid ""
"Choose which part of the timeline should be used for speech recognition "
"(**3**)"
msgstr ""
"Vyberte, ktorá časť časovej osi sa má použiť na rozpoznávanie reči (**3**)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:115
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:167
msgid ":guilabel:`Process` (**4**). Click to start the subtitle creation."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Spracovať` (**4**). Kliknite na spustenie vytvárania titulkov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:117
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:169
msgid "The subtitle is created and inserted automatically."
msgstr "Titulok je vytvorený a vložený automaticky."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:119
#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:171
msgid ""
"Remark to step **4**: The default is to analyze only the :guilabel:`Timeline "
"zone (all tracks)` (**2** in the screenshot above). Set the timeline zone to "
"what you want to analyze (use :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` to set in and out "
"points). :guilabel:`Selected clips` option analyses the selected clip only."
msgstr ""
"Poznámka k kroku **4**: Predvolene sa analyzuje iba :guilabel:`Zóna časovej "
"osi (všetky stopy)` (**2** na snímke obrazovky vyššie). Nastavte zónu "
"časovej osi na to, čo chcete analyzovať (použite :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O` na "
"nastavenie vstupných a výstupných bodov). Možnosť :guilabel:`Vybrané klipy` "
"analyzuje iba vybraný klip."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:123
msgid "Creating Subtitles using WHISPER Speech Recognition"
msgstr "Vytváranie titulkov pomocou rozpoznávania reči WHISPER"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:127
msgid ""
"If not yet created, add a subtitle track by clicking on the |add-subtitle|"
"\\ :guilabel:`Edit Subtitle Tool` icon in the Timeline tool bar (**11**)."
msgstr ""
"Ak ešte nebola vytvorená, pridajte stopu titulkov kliknutím na ikonu |add-"
"subtitle|\\ :guilabel:`Nástroj na úpravu titulkov` na paneli nástrojov "
"časovej osi (**11**)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:133
msgid "Automatic subtitle generation using the Whisper engine"
msgstr "Automatické generovanie titulkov pomocou engine Whisper"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:145
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Language`. Default is **Autodetect**. Change to the correct "
"language if not detected properly."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Jazyk`. Predvolené je **Automatická detekcia**. Zmeňte na správny "
"jazyk, ak nie je detekovaný správne."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Maximum character per line`. Define how many characters per line "
"are allowed before a line break is inserted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Maximálny počet znakov na riadok`. Definujte, koľko znakov na "
"riadok je povolených pred vložením zalomenia riadku."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Translate with SeamlessM4T`. Checking this opens adds two more "
"selection fields: One for the :guilabel:`Input language`, and one for the :"
"guilabel:`Output language`. This requires that translation with SeamlessM4T "
"is enabled in the settings (:menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure "
"Kdenlive --> Speech To Text`). Please refer to the chapter about :doc:"
"`Speech to Text </getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Preložiť pomocou SeamlessM4T`. Zaškrtnutím tejto možnosti sa "
"pridajú dve ďalšie polia výberu: jedno pre :guilabel:`Vstupný jazyk` a jedno "
"pre :guilabel:`Výstupný jazyk`. To vyžaduje, aby bolo prekladanie pomocou "
"SeamlessM4T povolené v nastaveniach (:menuselection:`Ponuka --> Nastavenia --"
"> Nastaviť Kdenlive --> Prevod reči na text`). Prečítajte si kapitolu o :doc:"
"`Prevod reči na text</getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Translate to English`. Select this to use *Whisper* for the "
"translation to English."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Preložiť do angličtiny`. Vyberte toto na použitie *Whisper* na "
"preklad do angličtiny."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:177
msgid "Translate with SeamlessM4T"
msgstr "Textový klip šablóny"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:183
msgid "Translating with SeamlessM4T"
msgstr "Prekladanie pomocou SeamlessM4T"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:185
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Input Language` and :guilabel:`Output Language` and click :"
"guilabel:`Process`."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte :guilabel:`Vstupný jazyk` a :guilabel:`Výstupný jazyk` a kliknite "
"na :guilabel:`Spracovať`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:187
msgid ""
"This will first process the audio using *Whisper*, then start the "
"*SeamlessM4T* translation. Translation can occupy 100% RAM, 100% CPU and "
"100% disk access."
msgstr ""
"Najprv sa spracuje zvuk pomocou *Whisper*, potom sa spustí preklad "
"*SeamlessM4T*. Preklad môže zaberať 100 % RAM, 100 % CPU a 100 % prístupu na "
"disk."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:192
msgid ""
"If the 9GB model has not yet been downloaded, it will be downloaded now. "
"With a 100MB/s download speed this will take about 12 minutes!"
msgstr ""
"Ak model veľkosti 9 GB ešte nebol stiahnutý, bude stiahnutý teraz. Pri "
"rýchlosti sťahovania 100 MB/s to bude trvať asi 12 minút!"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:194
msgid ""
"During download Kdenlive will react as normal. Do not click on :guilabel:"
"`Close`, otherwise the download is stopped."
msgstr ""
"Počas sťahovania bude Kdenlive reagovať normálne. Neklikajte na :guilabel:"
"`Zavrieť`, inak sa sťahovanie zastaví."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:201
msgid ""
"Don't worry if you see such a message on the box below :guilabel:"
"`Initializing translation model` while the download is running."
msgstr ""
"Nebojte sa, ak sa vám zobrazí takáto správa v poli pod :guilabel:"
"`Inicializácia modelu prekladu` počas prebiehajúceho sťahovania."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:203
msgid ""
"Depending on your internet connection and bandwidth, downloading the model "
"can take quite some time (about 12 minutes with 100MB/s download speed)."
msgstr ""
"V závislosti od vášho internetového pripojenia a šírky pásma môže sťahovanie "
"modelu trvať pomerne dlho (asi 12 minút pri rýchlosti sťahovania 100 MB/s)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:205
msgid "Once the translation model is downloaded, translation will start."
msgstr "Po stiahnutí modelu prekladu sa preklad spustí."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:236
msgid "Creating Clips using Speech Recognition"
msgstr "Vytváranie klipov pomocou rozpoznávania reči"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:238
msgid ""
"This is useful for interviews and other speech-related footage. Go to the "
"Speech Editor widget. If not yet enabled, do so via :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"View --> Speech Editor`."
msgstr ""
"Toto je užitočné pre rozhovory a iné záznamy súvisiace s rečou. Prejdite na "
"widget Editor reči. Ak ešte nie je povolený, aktivujte ho cez :menuselection:"
"`Ponuka --> Zobraziť --> Editor reči`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:240
msgid ""
"Using speech recognition to create transcripts and create clips from that, "
"is only possible with clips in the **Project Bin**."
msgstr ""
"Použitie rozpoznávania reči na vytváranie prepisov a klipov z nich je možné "
"iba s klipmi v **Kôši projektu**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:246
msgid "Shown with the VOSK engine and Search (10) enabled"
msgstr "Zobrazené s engine VOSK a povoleným vyhľadávaním (10)"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:248
msgid "Select a clip in the **Project Bin**."
msgstr "Vyberte klip v **Kôši projektu**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:250
msgid ""
"If needed, set in and out points in the **Clip Monitor** and check :guilabel:"
"`Selected zone only`. This will only transcribe text inside that zone."
msgstr ""
"V prípade potreby nastavte vstupné a výstupné body v **Monitore klipu** a "
"zaškrtnite :guilabel:`Iba vybraná zóna`. Tým sa prepíše iba text v danej "
"zóne."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:252
msgid ""
"Click on |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Hamburger Menu` and choose the "
"model for the correct language when the *VOSK* engine is set for speech "
"recognition. If the *Whisper* engine is selected, you can select :guilabel:"
"`Translate to English` if needed. You select the speech recognition engine "
"in :menuselection:`Menu --> Settings --> Configure Kdenlive --> Speech to "
"Text`. Click on :guilabel:`Configure Speech Recognition` to open the "
"configuration section for Speech to Text. For more details about the "
"configuration refer to the chapter :doc:`Configure Speech to Text </"
"getting_started/configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na |application-menu|\\ :guilabel:`Hamburgerové menu` a vyberte "
"model pre správny jazyk, keď je pre rozpoznávanie reči nastavený engine "
"*VOSK*. Ak je vybraný engine *Whisper*, môžete v prípade potreby vybrať :"
"guilabel:`Preložiť do angličtiny`. Engine rozpoznávania reči vyberiete v :"
"menuselection:`Ponuka --> Nastavenia --> Nastaviť Kdenlive --> Prevod reči "
"na text`. Kliknutím na :guilabel:`Nastaviť rozpoznávanie reči` otvoríte "
"konfiguračnú časť pre Prevod reči na text. Ďalšie podrobnosti o konfigurácii "
"nájdete v kapitole :doc:`Nakonfigurovať prevod reči na text</getting_started/"
"configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins>`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:254
msgid "Press the :guilabel:`Transcribe` button."
msgstr "Stlačte tlačidlo :guilabel:`Prepísať`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:256
msgid ""
"Select the text you want. Holding :kbd:`CTRL` or :kbd:`Shift` to select "
"several texts."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte požadovaný text. Podržte :kbd:`CTRL` alebo :kbd:`Shift` na výber "
"viacerých textov."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:258
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create new sequence with edit` creates a new sequence with each "
"timecode-text as a single clip. :guilabel:`Insert selection in timeline` "
"creates clips for each selected timecode-text starting at the playhead's "
"position. :guilabel:`Save edited text in a playlist file` creates an asset "
"in the project bin with the entire transcribed text."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Vytvoriť novú sekvenciu s úpravou` vytvorí novú sekvenciu s "
"každým časovým kódom-textom ako samostatným klipom. :guilabel:`Vložiť výber "
"do časovej osi` vytvorí klipy pre každý vybraný časový kód-text začínajúc na "
"pozícii prehrávača. :guilabel:`Uložiť upravený text do súboru playlistu` "
"vytvorí podklad v kôši projektu s celým prepísaným textom."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:260
msgid ""
"|format-font-size-more|\\ :guilabel:`Increase font size` and |format-font-"
"size-less|\\ :guilabel:`Decrease font size` decrease, respectively, increase "
"the font size."
msgstr ""
"|format-font-size-more|\\ :guilabel:`Zväčšiť veľkosť písma` a |format-font-"
"size-less|\\ :guilabel:`Zmenšiť veľkosť písma` zmenšia, resp. zväčšia "
"veľkosť písma."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:262
msgid ""
"|bookmark-new|\\ :guilabel:`Add marker` adds a marker for the timecode of "
"the selected text. More details about *Timeline Markers* and *Markers* are "
"available in the chapter about :doc:`/cutting_and_assembling/guides`."
msgstr ""
"|bookmark-new|\\ :guilabel:`Pridať značku` pridá značku pre časový kód "
"vybraného textu. Ďalšie podrobnosti o *Značkách časovej osi* a *Značkách* sú "
"k dispozícii v kapitole o :doc:`/cutting_and_assembling/guides`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:264
msgid "|edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Delete selection` deletes the selected text."
msgstr "|edit-delete|\\ :guilabel:`Odstrániť výber` odstráni vybraný text."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:266
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Remove non speech zones` deletes all \"No speech\" entries at "
"once."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Odstrániť zóny bez reči` vymaže všetky záznamy „Bez reči\" naraz."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:268
msgid ""
"|edit-find|\\ :guilabel:`Search in text` toggles the search field. Enter "
"text you want to find in the transcribed text. Search is not case sensitive "
"and finds all occurrences of the string even within words. |go-up| and |go-"
"down| navigate to the next occurrence of the search term. If the search "
"field turns reddish you have reached the last occurrence of the search term "
"in the text."
msgstr ""
"|edit-find|\\ :guilabel:`Hľadať v texte` prepína vyhľadávacie pole. Zadajte "
"text, ktorý chcete nájsť v prepísanom texte. Vyhľadávanie nerozlišuje malé a "
"veľké písmená a nájde všetky výskyty reťazca aj v rámci slov. |go-up| a |go-"
"down| navigujú na ďalší výskyt hľadaného výrazu. Ak vyhľadávacie pole "
"sčervenie, dosiahli ste posledný výskyt hľadaného výrazu v texte."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:274
msgid "Silence Detection"
msgstr "Detekcia ticha"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:276
msgid "This works with the VOSK engine only."
msgstr "Toto funguje iba s engine VOSK."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:278
msgid ""
"Select the clip in the **Project Bin** and open the speech editor window (:"
"menuselection:`Menu --> View --> Speech Editor`) ."
msgstr ""
"Vyberte klip v **Kôši projektu** a otvorte okno editora reči (:menuselection:"
"`Ponuka --> Zobraziť --> Editor reči`)."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:280
msgid ""
"Click on |application-menu|:guilabel:`Hamburger Menu` and choose the model "
"for your language. If the right model is not listed, click on :guilabel:"
"`Configure Speech Recognition`. For details about how to add models for the "
"*VOSK* engine refer to the chapter about :doc:`/getting_started/"
"configure_kdenlive/configuration_plugins`."
msgstr ""
"Kliknite na |application-menu|:guilabel:`Hamburgerové menu` a vyberte model "
"pre váš jazyk. Ak správny model nie je v zozname, kliknite na :guilabel:"
"`Nastaviť rozpoznávanie reči`. Podrobnosti o pridávaní modelov pre engine "
"*VOSK* nájdete v kapitole o :doc:`/getting_started/configure_kdenlive/"
"configuration_plugins`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:282
msgid "Then click :guilabel:`Start Recognition` button."
msgstr "Potom kliknite na tlačidlo :guilabel:`Spustiť rozpoznávanie`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:284
msgid ""
"Once this is done, choose under point 6 from above to :guilabel:`Remove non "
"speech zones` at once. Or click on the time-code where \"No speech\" is "
"indicated (hold :kbd:`Ctrl` to select several items at once) and just hit "
"the :kbd:`Delete` key."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončení vyberte pod bodom 6 zhora možnosť :guilabel:`Odstrániť zóny bez "
"reči` naraz. Alebo kliknite na časový kód, kde je indikované „Bez reči"
"\" (podržte :kbd:`Ctrl` na výber viacerých položiek naraz) a stlačte "
"klávesu :kbd:`Delete`."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:286
msgid ""
"Repeat the operation for all the parts you want to remove, including where "
"someone says what you do not want to include in your final edit."
msgstr ""
"Opakujte operáciu pre všetky časti, ktoré chcete odstrániť, vrátane miest, "
"kde niekto hovorí to, čo nechcete zahrnúť do svojej finálnej úpravy."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/speech_to_text.rst:288
msgid ""
"Once finished, make sure :guilabel:`Selected zone only` is disabled, click "
"on the :guilabel:`Save edited text in a playlist file` button (above under "
"point 5) and after few seconds a new playlist is added in the Project Bin "
"without silence and without the text you do not want."
msgstr ""
"Po dokončení sa uistite, že :guilabel:`Iba vybraná zóna` je vypnutá, "
"kliknite na tlačidlo :guilabel:`Uložiť upravený text do súboru playlistu` "
"(vyššie pod bodom 5) a po niekoľkých sekundách sa do Kôša projektu pridá "
"nový playlist bez ticha a bez textu, ktorý nechcete."

